---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Our Teachers" lang="en" description="The teachers of the Szent László Hungarian School.">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <h1 class="page-title">Our Teachers</h1>

    <article class="teacher">
      <div class="prose" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
        <h3>Huiné dr. Ungár Júlia</h3>
        <p>
          I was born in Délvidék (Vojvodina), where the survival of the Hungarian
          community was never something to be taken for granted. It is not here
          either — it has to be fought for. My goal is to preserve our Hungarian
          linguistic and cultural treasures and pass them on to the next
          generation, so that they too can appreciate and enjoy all that is
          beautiful, good, and true in our Christian Hungarian heritage, and in
          this way grow into adults who hold steadfastly to their faith, have a
          broad outlook, and are rooted deeply.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <p><em>The full list of our teachers is being uploaded.</em></p>
  </div>
</Base>
